    Monster battles an opponent's monster, any battle damage it inflicts to your
    opponent is doubled. During the Battle Phase (Quick Effect): You can Tribute
    this card; Special Summon up to 2 face-up \"Supreme King Dragon\" and/or \"Supreme
    King Gate\" Pendulum Monsters from your Extra Deck in Defense Position, except
    \"Supreme King Dragon Odd-Eyes\"."
